OL,3,GNEWSADisabled woman 'exhausted' by
OL,4,Amonths of housing limbo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disabled woman has described being
OL,7,Fleft "exhausted" after three months of
OL,8,Fhotel moves, claiming the council has
OL,9,Frepeatedly failed to offer her suitable
OL,10,Faccommodation.
OL,12,FKerenza McSweeney and partner Luke told
OL,13,Fthe BBC they were forced to leave their
OL,14,Fsocial housing in Abingdon,
OL,15,FOxfordshire, after problems with an
OL,16,Faggressive neighbour.
OL,18,FAfter being advised to leave, the
OL,19,Fcouple were placed in emergency
OL,20,Faccommodation and said they had since
OL,21,Fstayed in up to 15 rooms at numerous
OL,22,Fdifferent sites.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
