OL,3,GNEWSADisabled woman 'exhausted' by
OL,4,Amonths of housing limbo
OL,5,
OL,6,FVale of White Horse District Council
OL,7,Fsaid it had offered all relevant
OL,8,Fsupport available and was working with
OL,9,Fthe family, adding that "moving people
OL,10,Fon from temporary accommodation remains
OL,11,Fa priority".
